  content: {
    title: 'BharatFund Trader',
    summary: 'Prop trading challenges, live charts and funded account tracking in one app.',
    description: 'BharatFundedTrade is the official mobile app for traders taking BharatFundedTrade prop firm evaluations. Start a challenge, prove your skill, and manage your funded accounts  all from your phone.\r\n\r\nTAKE A CHALLENGE\r\nBrowse every available evaluation program in one place. Compare account sizes, profit targets, drawdown limits and pricing before you commit, then start your challenge in a few taps.\r\n\r\nTRACK EVERY ACCOUNT\r\nMy Challenges gives you a live list of all your accounts and exactly where each one stands  active, passed, funded or breached. Passed accounts get their own section so your funded stage is never buried.\r\n\r\nA DASHBOARD FOR EVERY CHALLENGE\r\nOpen any account to see equity, balance, realised and unrealised P&L, open positions, trading statistics and full rule progress on a single screen. Know how much room you have left against your daily and overall drawdown before you place the next trade.\r\n\r\nTRADE FROM THE TERMINAL\r\nA built-in trading terminal for your challenge accounts. Place, modify, close and cancel orders, and watch open positions and pending orders update in real time.\r\n\r\nPROFESSIONAL CHARTS\r\nFull TradingView charting with multiple timeframes, drawing tools and indicators, so you can analyse a setup and act on it without leaving the app.\r\n\r\nORDERS IN ONE PLACE\r\nOpen positions, pending orders and complete trade history, with filters to review how you have actually been trading.\r\n\r\nSTAY INFORMED\r\nLive price updates and instant in-app notifications for order fills, challenge status changes and account announcements.\r\n\r\nALSO INSIDE\r\n- Secure sign-up with OTP verification and password recovery\r\n- Profile and KYC management\r\n- Reports and billing history\r\n- Partner / IB section for referral performance\r\n- Dark and light themes\r\n- Direct contact with support\r\n\r\nBUILT FOR SERIOUS TRADERS\r\nCredentials are stored in your device\'s secure hardware-backed keystore, and every request to our servers runs over encrypted HTTPS. The app is designed to stay responsive on slower connections so a weak signal does not cost you a trade.\r\n\r\nWHO IT IS FOR\r\nTraders who want to prove themselves through a structured evaluation and scale up to a funded account, without being tied to a desktop.\r\n\r\nAn active BharatFundedTrade account is required to use this app. Challenge evaluations are conducted on simulated accounts.\r\n\r\nRISK DISCLOSURE\r\nTrading involves substantial risk and is not suitable for every investor. Past performance is not indicative of future results. You may lose the fees paid for an evaluation. Nothing in this app constitutes investment advice. Please assess your objectives and risk tolerance carefully before trading.\r\n\r\nQuestions or feedback? Reach us from the Contact screen inside the app  we read everything.',
